Comment: This stanza is a placeholder. vendor/ is populated by `go mod
 vendor` immediately before building the source package (see
 debian/rules) and is not present in the upstream git tree, so its
 contents can't be audited until then. Before the first upload, run
 `go mod vendor` followed by `licensecheck -r vendor/` (or
 `deb-scan-copyright`) and replace this stanza with one `Files:
 vendor/<module-path>/*` entry per distinct license actually found.

